(4462344, 640491, 84907, '<td valign="top">Great catch lights in the eyes and focus is spot on.  I might have liked the composition more with less negative space on the left side, but still is a very nice shot and think you did a great job with the shot.</td>', 'Great catch lights in the eyes and focus is spot on.  I might have liked the composition more with less negative space on the left side, but still is a very nice shot and think you did a great job with the shot.', '2008-02-06 01:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
