(4462361, 640198, 89811, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful brown and amber colours here <br/>There is so much clarity and depth</td>', 'I love the beautiful brown and amber colours here There is so much clarity and depth', '2008-02-06 01:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462369, 642990, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the way you framed this up.  Focus is spot on, and you captured the emotion very well.  Great use of light in a very difficult area with basic editing.  You are to be commended great shot.</td>', 'I love the way you framed this up.  Focus is spot on, and you captured the emotion very well.  Great use of light in a very difficult area with basic editing.  You are to be commended great shot.', '2008-02-06 01:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462383, 642550, 89811, '<td valign="top">I would never have thought about this as an eye, - but I like it so much</td>', 'I would never have thought about this as an eye, - but I like it so much', '2008-02-06 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462398, 642921, 84907, '<td valign="top">You have to love those eyes.  Great job with focus and also keeping good distance from the dog to keep long snout from becoming largely distorted in the frame.  I like the nice and even lighting in what appears to be a dark indoor scene otherwise.  My only concern is the framing/composition.  The crop in the middle of the ears can feel a bit uncomfortable, and I think if the dogs face were centered a bit more it would really take this shot to a different level.  That being said it is difficult to get any dog let alone a big dog to cooperate so great shot and one I am sure you will enjoy for years to come.</td>', 'You have to love those eyes.  Great job with focus and also keeping good distance from the dog to keep long snout from becoming largely distorted in the frame.  I like the nice and even lighting in what appears to be a dark indoor scene otherwise.  My only concern is the framing/composition.  The crop in the middle of the ears can feel a bit uncomfortable, and I think if the dogs face were centered a bit more it would really take this shot to a different level.  That being said it is difficult to get any dog let alone a big dog to cooperate so great shot and one I am sure you will enjoy for years to come.', '2008-02-06 01:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462403, 641656, 89811, '<td valign="top">so beautiful - I love the eyes</td>', 'so beautiful - I love the eyes', '2008-02-06 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462408, 641525, 89811, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo - thanks</td>', 'fantastic photo - thanks', '2008-02-06 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462421, 642443, 52130, '<td valign="top">looks super-pixelated</td>', 'looks super-pixelated', '2008-02-06 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462422, 641749, 84907, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is really all there is for me on this one.  I will undoubtedly be back to see how this one was done.  Macro is all that is coming to mind because  I don''t see any noise artifacts I would expect with a multiple enlargement.  Ok, back to the shot.  Great color obviously, and well controlled light.  I would have liked to see more of the top of the yellow, but no reason to quibble on such a nice shot.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, that is really all there is for me on this one.  I will undoubtedly be back to see how this one was done.  Macro is all that is coming to mind because  I don''t see any noise artifacts I would expect with a multiple enlargement.  Ok, back to the shot.  Great color obviously, and well controlled light.  I would have liked to see more of the top of the yellow, but no reason to quibble on such a nice shot.  Great job.', '2008-02-06 01:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462423, 642166, 84301, '<td valign="top">That it a handsome iguana eye right there!</td>', 'That it a handsome iguana eye right there!', '2008-02-06 01:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
