(4462687, 642712, 84907, '<td valign="top">Aww what a cute look!  Priceless memories of a family member.  :)  Great job on the focus and a great timing capture.  The flash is a bit harsh, but the most important part is capturing that moment, and you captured the moment indeed  :)</td>', 'Aww what a cute look!  Priceless memories of a family member.  :)  Great job on the focus and a great timing capture.  The flash is a bit harsh, but the most important part is capturing that moment, and you captured the moment indeed  :)', '2008-02-06 03:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4462692, 641637, 84907, '<td valign="top">Aww cute!  I am sure this will be a family favorite for lots of years.  Based upon some noise issues I am going to guess this is cropped in quite a bit from a larger shot really show off the eyes.  That paired with the fact that the eyes aren''t looking at the camera probably won''t grab a high score, but points aren''t as important as family memories, and I think you captured a great one.</td>', 'Aww cute!  I am sure this will be a family favorite for lots of years.  Based upon some noise issues I am going to guess this is cropped in quite a bit from a larger shot really show off the eyes.  That paired with the fact that the eyes aren''t looking at the camera probably won''t grab a high score, but points aren''t as important as family memories, and I think you captured a great one.', '2008-02-06 03:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
