(4462717, 642897, 84907, '<td valign="top">A fun splash of color and variety!  Great use of the mask to draw to the eyes.  Also a very nice job using the light to pop the eyes.  The only thing I can see that detracts is the crop mid chin, but the more you add down there the more you pick of things that detract from your main subject so I understand the cropping.  Nice capture and well done!</td>', 'A fun splash of color and variety!  Great use of the mask to draw to the eyes.  Also a very nice job using the light to pop the eyes.  The only thing I can see that detracts is the crop mid chin, but the more you add down there the more you pick of things that detract from your main subject so I understand the cropping.  Nice capture and well done!', '2008-02-06 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
