(4463124, 643025, 71526, '<td valign="top">Great Eyes, great High Key... good work. I like those expressive eyes, seems your subject is horrified, or perhaps surprised. Voting 8.</td>', 'Great Eyes, great High Key... good work. I like those expressive eyes, seems your subject is horrified, or perhaps surprised. Voting 8.', '2008-02-06 08:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
