(4463140, 642597, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish that larger catchlight wasn''t there.  It distracts me.  Perhaps if it were smaller...  Good composition and an interesting shot.</td>', 'I wish that larger catchlight wasn''t there.  It distracts me.  Perhaps if it were smaller...  Good composition and an interesting shot.', '2008-02-06 08:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4463142, 640376, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish there were less red around the bottom of the eye and that we could see the upper part of the iris, that it weren''t in shadow since a good portion of the part we can see is taken up with the reflection.  Good sharpness.</td>', 'I wish there were less red around the bottom of the eye and that we could see the upper part of the iris, that it weren''t in shadow since a good portion of the part we can see is taken up with the reflection.  Good sharpness.', '2008-02-06 08:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4463148, 642180, 86447, '<td valign="top">Well stot, but I''d prefer more room on the left for this fellow (gal?) to look into... giving him room to be alive...</td>', 'Well stot, but I''d prefer more room on the left for this fellow (gal?) to look into... giving him room to be alive...', '2008-02-06 08:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4463152, 641589, 86447, '<td valign="top">Cool shot... the bit of flash on the ''nose'' distracts from the feel of it being art, and makes it appear to be an out of focus shot.  If the flash spot were cropped out, it would really be an artsy shot.   IMHO.</td>', 'Cool shot... the bit of flash on the ''nose'' distracts from the feel of it being art, and makes it appear to be an out of focus shot.  If the flash spot were cropped out, it would really be an artsy shot.   IMHO.', '2008-02-06 08:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4463157, 641998, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The eyes appear to be over sharpened.  Perhaps this is a crop and the eyes just couldn''t hold up.  I like it, though.  The pattern on the face is well-framed. 7</td>', 'Great composition.  The eyes appear to be over sharpened.  Perhaps this is a crop and the eyes just couldn''t hold up.  I like it, though.  The pattern on the face is well-framed. 7', '2008-02-06 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4463159, 642921, 86447, '<td valign="top">Cutting off the tips of the ears and still having so much empty space to the right make this seem ill composed to me.  Beautiful dog.</td>', 'Cutting off the tips of the ears and still having so much empty space to the right make this seem ill composed to me.  Beautiful dog.', '2008-02-06 08:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
