(4464556, 641635, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''ve given a few 10s and this is one of them.  I really like the composition, the white foreground object in the upper right creates some tension and balances well with the bottom left white.  Of course those eyes are stealing the show and are so dramatic - as they should be for an eye challenge!</td>', 'I''ve given a few 10s and this is one of them.  I really like the composition, the white foreground object in the upper right creates some tension and balances well with the bottom left white.  Of course those eyes are stealing the show and are so dramatic - as they should be for an eye challenge!', '2008-02-06 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
