(4466107, 640605, 88561, '<td valign="top">IMO, This could have been a much more powerful (and higher scored) shot.  I would have liked to see a little tighter crop.  Because of some of the bright colors the audience is wearing, I find the background distracting.  But more of a negative is the sharpness.  I also find the lighting to be off, you may not be able to control that or edit for that, but the shot has a haze to it.  If this was in focus, especially his eyes, I would have scored nuch higher.  Because of it being out of focus, I scored where I did.</td>', 'IMO, This could have been a much more powerful (and higher scored) shot.  I would have liked to see a little tighter crop.  Because of some of the bright colors the audience is wearing, I find the background distracting.  But more of a negative is the sharpness.  I also find the lighting to be off, you may not be able to control that or edit for that, but the shot has a haze to it.  If this was in focus, especially his eyes, I would have scored nuch higher.  Because of it being out of focus, I scored where I did.', '2008-02-06 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
