(4467926, 641141, 76430, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s out of focus, bad red eye, and looks like a snapshot to me.</td>', 'Sorry, it''s out of focus, bad red eye, and looks like a snapshot to me.', '2008-02-07 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467954, 642866, 76430, '<td valign="top">This looks very strange and plastic.  I don''t know if it''s the lighting, procesing or what.  Maybe the title explains it, but I don''t understand what it means.  I do like the composition, but not the finish.</td>', 'This looks very strange and plastic.  I don''t know if it''s the lighting, procesing or what.  Maybe the title explains it, but I don''t understand what it means.  I do like the composition, but not the finish.', '2008-02-07 10:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
