(4468065, 642743, 76430, '<td valign="top">Rather than the window to the soul it looks like the window to the camera and room.  Other than the pupil reflection it''s a nice picture.  Sharp and detailed.  I know it''s a cat, but it looks like a still promo picture from a sci-fi picture, "Species" I think.</td>', 'Rather than the window to the soul it looks like the window to the camera and room.  Other than the pupil reflection it''s a nice picture.  Sharp and detailed.  I know it''s a cat, but it looks like a still promo picture from a sci-fi picture, "Species" I think.', '2008-02-07 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468073, 643175, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hawaiian words?  This composition really justifies the long framing.  The focus could have been much better to catch the eyes of both of the models much better.  I''d recommend better lighting and a higher f stop.</td>', 'Hawaiian words?  This composition really justifies the long framing.  The focus could have been much better to catch the eyes of both of the models much better.  I''d recommend better lighting and a higher f stop.', '2008-02-07 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468101, 642875, 61138, '<td valign="top">I think the glitter detracts from what is a great photo. All the elements are there already...lighting, focus, composition. Without glitter...I''d give it 8. With the glitter...a 6.</td>', 'I think the glitter detracts from what is a great photo. All the elements are there already...lighting, focus, composition. Without glitter...I''d give it 8. With the glitter...a 6.', '2008-02-07 11:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468108, 642738, 61138, '<td valign="top">Cool. The OOF background and the composition puts his eye in just the right place, and his expression communicates the feeling. Nicely done. 8.</td>', 'Cool. The OOF background and the composition puts his eye in just the right place, and his expression communicates the feeling. Nicely done. 8.', '2008-02-07 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468109, 642753, 79335, '<td valign="top">very original! 6</td>', 'very original! 6', '2008-02-07 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
