(4468132, 642511, 89431, '<td valign="top">awwwwww</td>', 'awwwwww', '2008-02-07 11:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468133, 643142, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting high key shot.  Based on the shadows and reflectin I''m guessing the on-camera flash was used with the camera upside down.  The shadows are a bit harsh and the eye is pretty grainy.  I don''t like the blob on the lower right.  I think it would be more effective if you had cropped out the lower-right third of the picture and maybe gotten a little more eyebrow.</td>', 'Interesting high key shot.  Based on the shadows and reflectin I''m guessing the on-camera flash was used with the camera upside down.  The shadows are a bit harsh and the eye is pretty grainy.  I don''t like the blob on the lower right.  I think it would be more effective if you had cropped out the lower-right third of the picture and maybe gotten a little more eyebrow.', '2008-02-07 11:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468134, 642800, 89431, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better without the neon glow filter..</td>', 'I think this would have looked better without the neon glow filter..', '2008-02-07 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468139, 642578, 89431, '<td valign="top">This couldn''t have been done with basic editing, it''s a little creepie too...</td>', 'This couldn''t have been done with basic editing, it''s a little creepie too...', '2008-02-07 11:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468142, 642293, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Good reflection and body art.  Good focus on the eye.  Personally I''d like to see the entire eye rather than cropping out the right edge.  It''s a little blown out lighting in parts, but otherwise nice lighting.  8</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Good reflection and body art.  Good focus on the eye.  Personally I''d like to see the entire eye rather than cropping out the right edge.  It''s a little blown out lighting in parts, but otherwise nice lighting.  8', '2008-02-07 11:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468146, 641949, 61138, '<td valign="top">I bet a lot of people will comment that the wrist in the foreground doesn''t work. Otherwise this is very nice. The lighting is nicely balanced against the dark background. The model is pretty and her expression engaging. You might want to crop more off the top and move her off-centre for a stronger composition.</td>', 'I bet a lot of people will comment that the wrist in the foreground doesn''t work. Otherwise this is very nice. The lighting is nicely balanced against the dark background. The model is pretty and her expression engaging. You might want to crop more off the top and move her off-centre for a stronger composition.', '2008-02-07 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468148, 641920, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and shot, but the focus seems a bit off and the reflection blotting out much of the eye is distracting.</td>', 'Nice composition and shot, but the focus seems a bit off and the reflection blotting out much of the eye is distracting.', '2008-02-07 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
