(4470579, 642880, 79095, '<td valign="top">This is great photograph. It has lots of layers, something that is very, very difficult to capture. The best thing is that the picture itself is simple - a portrait highlighting the eyes. Great ''window into the soul'' stuff here, lots of story that is further enhanced by then moving one''s own eye around the picture. Love the hat. Really love the use of light.</td>', 'This is great photograph. It has lots of layers, something that is very, very difficult to capture. The best thing is that the picture itself is simple - a portrait highlighting the eyes. Great ''window into the soul'' stuff here, lots of story that is further enhanced by then moving one''s own eye around the picture. Love the hat. Really love the use of light.', '2008-02-08 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470582, 643071, 79095, '<td valign="top">This has such depth of detail. I can''t stop looking at it, exploring it.</td>', 'This has such depth of detail. I can''t stop looking at it, exploring it.', '2008-02-08 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470586, 642456, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice. A bit spooky, but totally draws the viewer''s eye to the eye. Nice execution.</td>', 'Nice. A bit spooky, but totally draws the viewer''s eye to the eye. Nice execution.', '2008-02-08 08:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470590, 643030, 79095, '<td valign="top">This is the best concept for a shot of the competition. You really went outsight the box, yet stayed right in it by simply looking from another direction. I would give this  9 or 10 if the focus was actually on the eyeball. As is it is still worthy of a nice score. Nice work.</td>', 'This is the best concept for a shot of the competition. You really went outsight the box, yet stayed right in it by simply looking from another direction. I would give this  9 or 10 if the focus was actually on the eyeball. As is it is still worthy of a nice score. Nice work.', '2008-02-08 08:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470592, 642875, 79095, '<td valign="top">Lovely. There''s so much potential distraction here, but your framing and DoF make sure that the viewer''s eye is always drawn back to that one magical spot. Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely. There''s so much potential distraction here, but your framing and DoF make sure that the viewer''s eye is always drawn back to that one magical spot. Nice work.', '2008-02-08 08:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470604, 641749, 79095, '<td valign="top">I love the framing of this, but I really wanted it to be sharper. Nice idea.</td>', 'I love the framing of this, but I really wanted it to be sharper. Nice idea.', '2008-02-08 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470610, 642849, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great framing and great angle. This is truly beautiful and very nicely executed.</td>', 'Great framing and great angle. This is truly beautiful and very nicely executed.', '2008-02-08 08:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470613, 642536, 79141, '<td valign="top">ouchhhhhhhhhhhhh</td>', 'ouchhhhhhhhhhhhh', '2008-02-08 08:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470643, 642364, 88613, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I think you might have oversaturated the eyes because the blue is bleeding out onto the white part of the eye. Otherwise a really nice pic!</td>', 'Great shot, I think you might have oversaturated the eyes because the blue is bleeding out onto the white part of the eye. Otherwise a really nice pic!', '2008-02-08 09:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470645, 642881, 88613, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. It looks like your focus was on the eye lid making the actual eye a little soft but still a very nice shot.</td>', 'Pretty shot. It looks like your focus was on the eye lid making the actual eye a little soft but still a very nice shot.', '2008-02-08 09:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4470647, 642876, 88613, '<td valign="top">If this had been a little sharper it would have easily been one of the best on here. Great shot, just a little blurry.</td>', 'If this had been a little sharper it would have easily been one of the best on here. Great shot, just a little blurry.', '2008-02-08 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
