(4471001, 642861, 70100, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl but really soft and OOF.</td>', 'Pretty girl but really soft and OOF.', '2008-02-08 11:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471011, 642516, 76430, '<td valign="top">OK, they''re round, but not similar enough to eyes to fit the challenge well.  The rest of the picture isn''t very interesting, at least in B/W.  Maybe it would look better if you could have gotten more head-on with the culverts and gotten just the four circles in the frame.</td>', 'OK, they''re round, but not similar enough to eyes to fit the challenge well.  The rest of the picture isn''t very interesting, at least in B/W.  Maybe it would look better if you could have gotten more head-on with the culverts and gotten just the four circles in the frame.', '2008-02-08 11:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471015, 642123, 76430, '<td valign="top">I hope this is legal.  Very interesting pupils and a nice face to go with them.</td>', 'I hope this is legal.  Very interesting pupils and a nice face to go with them.', '2008-02-08 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471022, 641949, 70100, '<td valign="top">She''s on a date.  She looks across the table quietly thinking "What a moron". LOL  This could use some skin smoothing and a little reduction of the hot spots above her eyebrow and below her eye.  Great shot anyway.</td>', 'She''s on a date.  She looks across the table quietly thinking "What a moron". LOL  This could use some skin smoothing and a little reduction of the hot spots above her eyebrow and below her eye.  Great shot anyway.', '2008-02-08 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471023, 642955, 70100, '<td valign="top">I like this because I can''t really tell her mood but I know there is one.  Is she sad, amused, pensive?  The mystery makes the shot.  OH yeah, she''s also pretty.</td>', 'I like this because I can''t really tell her mood but I know there is one.  Is she sad, amused, pensive?  The mystery makes the shot.  OH yeah, she''s also pretty.', '2008-02-08 11:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
