(4473560, 642480, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: Great macro, everything is clear and in focus. nice natural colors and in the eye. No overexposure or anything else wrong.<br/>dislike: nothing i can think of. maybe deeper DOF but....it works.</td>', 'Like: Great macro, everything is clear and in focus. nice natural colors and in the eye. No overexposure or anything else wrong.dislike: nothing i can think of. maybe deeper DOF but....it works.', '2008-02-09 18:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473561, 641339, 89479, '<td valign="top">like: Great shot, love the expression on the cat. Well done keeping the blacks from underexposing while not washing out the white. Focus and subject are well drawn to the eyes.<br/>Dislike: Im not sure what color the white is on the cat but, using levels you may have made the white part more white.</td>', 'like: Great shot, love the expression on the cat. Well done keeping the blacks from underexposing while not washing out the white. Focus and subject are well drawn to the eyes.Dislike: Im not sure what color the white is on the cat but, using levels you may have made the white part more white.', '2008-02-09 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473565, 642738, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: amazing photo, really catches the moment. Great b/w conversion. technically flawless. This just may get a ribbon. <br/>Dislike: umm.... i got nothin.</td>', 'Like: amazing photo, really catches the moment. Great b/w conversion. technically flawless. This just may get a ribbon. Dislike: umm.... i got nothin.', '2008-02-09 18:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473566, 640791, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: Great detail on the blacks, while keeping the whites from blowing out. Eyes are certainly subject of the shot. Composition good.<br/>Dislike: Nothing i dont like...</td>', 'Like: Great detail on the blacks, while keeping the whites from blowing out. Eyes are certainly subject of the shot. Composition good.Dislike: Nothing i dont like...', '2008-02-09 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473567, 642439, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: Closeup, and great on the reflection. <br/>Dislike: Blurry eye, colors dont have any vibrance.<br/>6</td>', 'Like: Closeup, and great on the reflection. Dislike: Blurry eye, colors dont have any vibrance.6', '2008-02-09 18:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473568, 643025, 89479, '<td valign="top">Likes: Its a cool artistic approach to the subject. Eyes are vivid and sharp, DOF is good. <br/>Dislikes: Its more of a personal preference if one likes the approach, I love the artistic approach. But if i had to pick something i guess more shadow detail around the eyes?</td>', 'Likes: Its a cool artistic approach to the subject. Eyes are vivid and sharp, DOF is good. Dislikes: Its more of a personal preference if one likes the approach, I love the artistic approach. But if i had to pick something i guess more shadow detail around the eyes?', '2008-02-09 18:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473569, 642352, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: great capture, quite unique.  Lighting is good, and so is composition.<br/>Dislike: Theres no eyes in the shot..... its too soft focus....lost a lot of quality in jpeg conversion.</td>', 'Like: great capture, quite unique.  Lighting is good, and so is composition.Dislike: Theres no eyes in the shot..... its too soft focus....lost a lot of quality in jpeg conversion.', '2008-02-09 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473571, 641631, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: eyes and lighting is great.<br/>dislike: IMO i highly dislike your "border". Curious to see what other members will think.</td>', 'Like: eyes and lighting is great.dislike: IMO i highly dislike your "border". Curious to see what other members will think.', '2008-02-09 18:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473572, 642507, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: nice capture, eye is well framed. Lighting is good on the subject.<br/>Dislike: There isnt really anything that would draw my attention to this shot. Its not completely sharp and the eye is squinted.</td>', 'Like: nice capture, eye is well framed. Lighting is good on the subject.Dislike: There isnt really anything that would draw my attention to this shot. Its not completely sharp and the eye is squinted.', '2008-02-09 18:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473574, 642652, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: Lighting on the left side of the face is nice, but a little harsh.<br/>Dislike: This is more of a snapshot IMO. There is nothing that draws my attention to this photo for the eyes. The crop is too tight, the background is dull.</td>', 'Like: Lighting on the left side of the face is nice, but a little harsh.Dislike: This is more of a snapshot IMO. There is nothing that draws my attention to this photo for the eyes. The crop is too tight, the background is dull.', '2008-02-09 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473575, 640107, 89479, '<td valign="top">The blurry shot doesnt do it for me. There is also a fair amount of noise.</td>', 'The blurry shot doesnt do it for me. There is also a fair amount of noise.', '2008-02-09 18:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4473582, 641343, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is really neat. I love your use of lines and angles and you really used the lighting well to create the mood. It is refreshing to see someone step outside the box a bit. Very cool!</td>', 'This is really neat. I love your use of lines and angles and you really used the lighting well to create the mood. It is refreshing to see someone step outside the box a bit. Very cool!', '2008-02-09 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
