(4473591, 642293, 70000, '<td valign="top">The design in the eye is really cool on its own i think. The paint doesn''t really add because the colors are distracting. This would probably be stronger either in black and white or without the paint.</td>', 'The design in the eye is really cool on its own i think. The paint doesn''t really add because the colors are distracting. This would probably be stronger either in black and white or without the paint.', '2008-02-09 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
