(4474505, 642293, 82814, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that the cross in the eye reflection is an addition to the orignial shot - if not, I''m very impressed.  Without knowing otherwise, I have to vote a 7.</td>', 'I am assuming that the cross in the eye reflection is an addition to the orignial shot - if not, I''m very impressed.  Without knowing otherwise, I have to vote a 7.', '2008-02-10 03:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474510, 643186, 82814, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture.  I get the impression that she''s about to "spill the beans" on some really juicy gossip.  This is one of the better submissions as far as interest in the eyes.  It may have had more impact if you cropped this image down to just the face, removing both the top and bottom 1/3''s of this shot in equal proportions - just my impression.  A very good capture overall regardless.</td>', 'An interesting capture.  I get the impression that she''s about to "spill the beans" on some really juicy gossip.  This is one of the better submissions as far as interest in the eyes.  It may have had more impact if you cropped this image down to just the face, removing both the top and bottom 1/3''s of this shot in equal proportions - just my impression.  A very good capture overall regardless.', '2008-02-10 03:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474512, 642970, 82814, '<td valign="top">I like the intensity of this capture.  Her eye speaks volumes about her mood.</td>', 'I like the intensity of this capture.  Her eye speaks volumes about her mood.', '2008-02-10 03:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474517, 642969, 82814, '<td valign="top">I don''t know weather to like this or hate this - it is both odd and interesting at the same time.  Cudos for capturing something something very unique and uncomparible in this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know weather to like this or hate this - it is both odd and interesting at the same time.  Cudos for capturing something something very unique and uncomparible in this challenge.', '2008-02-10 03:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474521, 643020, 82814, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t until I saw this in a second glance that I realized the reflection in the eye.  Because of the eyelashes covering the reflection, I am going to assume this is not altered.  Therefore, I must say this is a superb capture and a very fittingly titled.</td>', 'It wasn''t until I saw this in a second glance that I realized the reflection in the eye.  Because of the eyelashes covering the reflection, I am going to assume this is not altered.  Therefore, I must say this is a superb capture and a very fittingly titled.', '2008-02-10 03:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474522, 640847, 82814, '<td valign="top">Superb macro shot, but not esthetically pleasing (to me).  Excellent detail and crispness in this shot.</td>', 'Superb macro shot, but not esthetically pleasing (to me).  Excellent detail and crispness in this shot.', '2008-02-10 03:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474524, 640291, 82814, '<td valign="top">An outstanding persepctive.  I don''t care if this was intentional or by accident - this is superb. 9!</td>', 'An outstanding persepctive.  I don''t care if this was intentional or by accident - this is superb. 9!', '2008-02-10 03:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474527, 643090, 82814, '<td valign="top">A unique entry.  Not many have thought about entering an image of an insect into this challenge.  As much as I see the eyes, my first focus was on the wings and the legs of the butterly.  Some creative cropping might have changed my perspective on this.  Regardless, overall this is an outstanding capture.</td>', 'A unique entry.  Not many have thought about entering an image of an insect into this challenge.  As much as I see the eyes, my first focus was on the wings and the legs of the butterly.  Some creative cropping might have changed my perspective on this.  Regardless, overall this is an outstanding capture.', '2008-02-10 03:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474619, 643018, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the eyes. I think this is one of the best images in the challenge. It has a very beautifully delicate feel to it.</td>', 'Nice focus on the eyes. I think this is one of the best images in the challenge. It has a very beautifully delicate feel to it.', '2008-02-10 06:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474620, 642946, 58247, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Excellent for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice. Excellent for this challenge.', '2008-02-10 06:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474621, 641832, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and great colors. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and great colors. Nice job.', '2008-02-10 06:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474627, 642861, 58247, '<td valign="top">If the hair was not blocking her eye, this would be a great image. For this challenge (for me) both eyes should be in the shot and at least one of the eyes has to be in sharp focus. If the hair was not blocking her eye that is in focus, I''d give this a good score. I do like the idea and overall processing though.</td>', 'If the hair was not blocking her eye, this would be a great image. For this challenge (for me) both eyes should be in the shot and at least one of the eyes has to be in sharp focus. If the hair was not blocking her eye that is in focus, I''d give this a good score. I do like the idea and overall processing though.', '2008-02-10 06:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474635, 642711, 64670, '<td valign="top">Would have been great without the white skin showing I think.</td>', 'Would have been great without the white skin showing I think.', '2008-02-10 06:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
