(4474640, 643030, 64670, '<td valign="top">Magic WONDERFUL Image - WOW!  I think this is SO AWESOME!  Hope it gets the recognition it deserves.</td>', 'Magic WONDERFUL Image - WOW!  I think this is SO AWESOME!  Hope it gets the recognition it deserves.', '2008-02-10 06:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474648, 643058, 53147, '<td valign="top">Sharp. You do lovely work with your daughter.</td>', 'Sharp. You do lovely work with your daughter.', '2008-02-10 06:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474661, 642491, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the sharp focus on the eyes peering through the head piece. Nice composition. Medallions are lit very well and draw interest. Contrast of metal vs. eyes is great in this close up view. Well done!</td>', 'Great shot. Love the sharp focus on the eyes peering through the head piece. Nice composition. Medallions are lit very well and draw interest. Contrast of metal vs. eyes is great in this close up view. Well done!', '2008-02-10 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474662, 642990, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Lighting, focus and simplicity draw attention to the eyes. Emotion definitely comes through.</td>', 'Nice composition. Lighting, focus and simplicity draw attention to the eyes. Emotion definitely comes through.', '2008-02-10 07:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474663, 641074, 88204, '<td valign="top">Focus isn''t quite sharp enough on the eye. Lighting highlights lower portion of image over the eye.</td>', 'Focus isn''t quite sharp enough on the eye. Lighting highlights lower portion of image over the eye.', '2008-02-10 07:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474664, 642438, 88204, '<td valign="top">Black and white simplifies and draws attention to key focus point... the eyes. I''m guessing there were some beautiful colors in the skin, hair and eyes but I like having to guess at them due to B&amp;W. Nicely done.</td>', 'Black and white simplifies and draws attention to key focus point... the eyes. I''m guessing there were some beautiful colors in the skin, hair and eyes but I like having to guess at them due to B&W. Nicely done.', '2008-02-10 07:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474666, 642534, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ooh... spooky eye! Like the close crop. Focus doesn''t seem quite sharp enough on the eye... or maybe it''s that the eye needs to be just a bit brighter.</td>', 'Ooh... spooky eye! Like the close crop. Focus doesn''t seem quite sharp enough on the eye... or maybe it''s that the eye needs to be just a bit brighter.', '2008-02-10 07:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474668, 641525, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great eyes! The ice blue of the eyes goes great with the snowy face. Who did his hair and make up?! Very nice! I might like it just a touch brighter with a litle more saturation to emphasize that ice blue. Well done!</td>', 'Wow! Great eyes! The ice blue of the eyes goes great with the snowy face. Who did his hair and make up?! Very nice! I might like it just a touch brighter with a litle more saturation to emphasize that ice blue. Well done!', '2008-02-10 07:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474669, 642872, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot of dueling cats. I''m not quite drawn to the eyes enough, although the ones in the lower right are intruiging. I wish they jumped out at me just a little more.</td>', 'Interesting shot of dueling cats. I''m not quite drawn to the eyes enough, although the ones in the lower right are intruiging. I wish they jumped out at me just a little more.', '2008-02-10 07:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474670, 641909, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color. The eye isn''t quite sharp enough but still a nice image.</td>', 'Great composition and color. The eye isn''t quite sharp enough but still a nice image.', '2008-02-10 07:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474671, 641054, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like that you chose to include only one eye. I think it gets the expression and emotion across. Lips are great too... seems like an old soul. I like the reflection of the horizon in the iris. Well done.</td>', 'I like that you chose to include only one eye. I think it gets the expression and emotion across. Lips are great too... seems like an old soul. I like the reflection of the horizon in the iris. Well done.', '2008-02-10 07:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474672, 640477, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting. The eye really jumps out. Might be nice to try to get it off center in the frame.</td>', 'Interesting lighting. The eye really jumps out. Might be nice to try to get it off center in the frame.', '2008-02-10 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474674, 642933, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the repeating elements. Fish eyes are interesting... they''re so vacant! Whatever is in front of the lower right eye is a slight distration. I think you could have cropped in even closer to remove some of the lower part of the frame. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the repeating elements. Fish eyes are interesting... they''re so vacant! Whatever is in front of the lower right eye is a slight distration. I think you could have cropped in even closer to remove some of the lower part of the frame. Nicely done.', '2008-02-10 07:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474676, 641234, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow... two different colors! Great stare! I think you could have done a closer crop. Also, I think I''d like the eyes away from the center of the frame.</td>', 'Wow... two different colors! Great stare! I think you could have done a closer crop. Also, I think I''d like the eyes away from the center of the frame.', '2008-02-10 07:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474677, 641995, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cute! Great expression. Focus is just slightly off. I think I''d like the eyes somewhere other than the center of the frame... maybe crop it so the head fills the upper left corner of the frame.</td>', 'Cute! Great expression. Focus is just slightly off. I think I''d like the eyes somewhere other than the center of the frame... maybe crop it so the head fills the upper left corner of the frame.', '2008-02-10 07:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474681, 642711, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. I had to stop and think how you got this effect. Interesting contrast of black face and white shoulder and ear... contrast of races. The eyes are hostile. Does the black skin make it hostile? That raises interesting questions on race. Love the contrast of white eyes against a dark face. This one made me think! Well done!</td>', 'Very dramatic. I had to stop and think how you got this effect. Interesting contrast of black face and white shoulder and ear... contrast of races. The eyes are hostile. Does the black skin make it hostile? That raises interesting questions on race. Love the contrast of white eyes against a dark face. This one made me think! Well done!', '2008-02-10 07:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474682, 641726, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great concept! I love the close crop and repeating elements. The bridal is a nice framing element that leads you into the frame. Neither eye looks quite sharp... it might be but I don''t perceive it that way. Great shot!</td>', 'Great concept! I love the close crop and repeating elements. The bridal is a nice framing element that leads you into the frame. Neither eye looks quite sharp... it might be but I don''t perceive it that way. Great shot!', '2008-02-10 07:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474683, 640585, 88204, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out how you did this within basic editing. If you did I''m highly impressed and would love to know how! Very intruiging and spooky.</td>', 'I can''t figure out how you did this within basic editing. If you did I''m highly impressed and would love to know how! Very intruiging and spooky.', '2008-02-10 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474684, 642946, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the different expressions between the two girls... playful on the left and intense on the right. Great composition and focus on the eyes. The B&amp;W really keeps me focused on the eyes and lips, which is what carry all of the emotion. My favorite so far!</td>', 'I love the different expressions between the two girls... playful on the left and intense on the right. Great composition and focus on the eyes. The B&W really keeps me focused on the eyes and lips, which is what carry all of the emotion. My favorite so far!', '2008-02-10 07:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474685, 642050, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Very dramatic. I''d love to see the setup for this! I love it!</td>', 'Wow!!! Very dramatic. I''d love to see the setup for this! I love it!', '2008-02-10 07:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474686, 643029, 88204, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel warm all over! Nice close crop and DoF.</td>', 'This makes me feel warm all over! Nice close crop and DoF.', '2008-02-10 07:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474688, 642788, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! The subject is definitely you, not the eye, which is an interesting take on the challenge. It almost look super imposed. Well done. I think I would have brought up the levels slightly.</td>', 'Very interesting! The subject is definitely you, not the eye, which is an interesting take on the challenge. It almost look super imposed. Well done. I think I would have brought up the levels slightly.', '2008-02-10 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474690, 641661, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great reflections and detail! I love the shadows of the lashes in the iris and the bright light rays in the corner of the eye. Water droplets add interest and intensity. Very "eye" catching!!</td>', 'Wow! Great reflections and detail! I love the shadows of the lashes in the iris and the bright light rays in the corner of the eye. Water droplets add interest and intensity. Very "eye" catching!!', '2008-02-10 07:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474691, 643018, 88204, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! .. and nice shot too! I like the wide angle... really draws focus to the face and expression.</td>', 'Congratulations! .. and nice shot too! I like the wide angle... really draws focus to the face and expression.', '2008-02-10 07:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474693, 640291, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great composition! Just enough eye to let us know what we''re seeing. Those loooooong lashes are very interesting too. Very nice!</td>', 'Wow! Great composition! Just enough eye to let us know what we''re seeing. Those loooooong lashes are very interesting too. Very nice!', '2008-02-10 07:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
