(4474697, 642123, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot! (Did you really do this within basic editing? If so I''m HIGHLY impressed!) I love the smooth skin and soft focus, yet you didn''t lose focus on those gourgeous and intruiging eyes. Outstanding! I can''t wait to learn more about how you did it!</td>', 'Great shot! (Did you really do this within basic editing? If so I''m HIGHLY impressed!) I love the smooth skin and soft focus, yet you didn''t lose focus on those gourgeous and intruiging eyes. Outstanding! I can''t wait to learn more about how you did it!', '2008-02-10 07:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474698, 640671, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression. Lighting could be softer.</td>', 'Great expression. Lighting could be softer.', '2008-02-10 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
