(4480731, 642565, 68586, '<td valign="top">I always find it disappointing when a striking shot has no title to go with it . . a title can be used for many things - to explain a shot, to lead the viewer into a shot, to highlight a feature of the shot, to give context and depth to the 2D image . . even just to give a documentary fact about the shot - so if anyone wonders what sort of bird it is with such striking green and gold on their face they will know.<br/> <br/>Nice shot - shame about the title  :- )</td>', 'I always find it disappointing when a striking shot has no title to go with it . . a title can be used for many things - to explain a shot, to lead the viewer into a shot, to highlight a feature of the shot, to give context and depth to the 2D image . . even just to give a documentary fact about the shot - so if anyone wonders what sort of bird it is with such striking green and gold on their face they will know. Nice shot - shame about the title  :- )', '2008-02-12 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
