(4480747, 642580, 68586, '<td valign="top">Delightful colours and detail.<br/> <br/>I guess slightly debatable whether this is more of a portrait of the parrots head than a shot about eyes - but a very nice shot.</td>', 'Delightful colours and detail. I guess slightly debatable whether this is more of a portrait of the parrots head than a shot about eyes - but a very nice shot.', '2008-02-12 15:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
