(4483125, 643030, 35804, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot but I''m not surprised it didn''t score better...tis the nature of the DPC beast. There is no doubt that it pleased more than a handful of us though. Seriously one of my top picks of the challenge...a most unique and well executed take on the challenge. This is a picture I wish I had taken. Beautiful work as usual.</td>', 'Fabulous shot but I''m not surprised it didn''t score better...tis the nature of the DPC beast. There is no doubt that it pleased more than a handful of us though. Seriously one of my top picks of the challenge...a most unique and well executed take on the challenge. This is a picture I wish I had taken. Beautiful work as usual.', '2008-02-13 10:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483137, 642875, 58785, '<td valign="top">Congrats Judi :)</td>', 'Congrats Judi :)', '2008-02-13 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483192, 643061, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well you beat me again lol.  I love her eye color and that it looks like she''s peeking into the frame.  Not sure what people were looking for but this did not deserve scores below 5.  I think if you were to do anything differently, you could make her switch the hat around so the brown flower is not there, and then center up the eyes.  Her eyes are beautiful enough to stand on their own in a pic like this.</td>', 'Well you beat me again lol.  I love her eye color and that it looks like she''s peeking into the frame.  Not sure what people were looking for but this did not deserve scores below 5.  I think if you were to do anything differently, you could make her switch the hat around so the brown flower is not there, and then center up the eyes.  Her eyes are beautiful enough to stand on their own in a pic like this.', '2008-02-13 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
