(4486666, 641520, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s the type of challenge photo that succumbs to being viewed in the context of many others.  The eye tires, sometimes quick decisions are made, the mind still has the effect of the last viewed photo on board...  Challenges can prevent true appreciation of photos.  I suppose they are meant to single out what one prefers, after all.  This photo of yours is elegant in a passive manner.  I came back to appreciate it and I do appreciate it much more now that it is one its own and not with others.</td>', 'It''s the type of challenge photo that succumbs to being viewed in the context of many others.  The eye tires, sometimes quick decisions are made, the mind still has the effect of the last viewed photo on board...  Challenges can prevent true appreciation of photos.  I suppose they are meant to single out what one prefers, after all.  This photo of yours is elegant in a passive manner.  I came back to appreciate it and I do appreciate it much more now that it is one its own and not with others.', '2008-02-14 13:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
