(4487521, 643017, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The eyes really glow!</td>', 'Nicely done. The eyes really glow!', '2008-02-14 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4487578, 640107, 48471, '<td valign="top">I see this fost-focusing technique as a way of peeling the meanings and interpretations from a photo to reach to the image. See, for example, in "archetype", all the information about the building is removed, and all I get to see is the shape and geometry, which is enough for a pleasant experience, it''s a nice new way at looking at the interaction of the building with the space (although, in this particular case, the space is the sky).<br/> <br/>Not here. In this case, this photo, I think, is a failure. I can''t see anything interesting, pleasant, or engaging in the shape, colour, or even message, that will make this photo become an image. Too little thought and passion and imagination has gone into producing this thing, hence it offers too little.<br/> <br/>I leave the door open, and go to look if I am suffering from hyperopia.</td>', 'I see this fost-focusing technique as a way of peeling the meanings and interpretations from a photo to reach to the image. See, for example, in "archetype", all the information about the building is removed, and all I get to see is the shape and geometry, which is enough for a pleasant experience, it''s a nice new way at looking at the interaction of the building with the space (although, in this particular case, the space is the sky). Not here. In this case, this photo, I think, is a failure. I can''t see anything interesting, pleasant, or engaging in the shape, colour, or even message, that will make this photo become an image. Too little thought and passion and imagination has gone into producing this thing, hence it offers too little. I leave the door open, and go to look if I am suffering from hyperopia.', '2008-02-14 21:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4487777, 641749, 90269, '<td valign="top">The color and the clarity are surreal.</td>', 'The color and the clarity are surreal.', '2008-02-14 22:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4487779, 640965, 57032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jhess77:</b></div><hr/><i> Strong eyes, a bit over exposed </i></td></tr></table> <br/>How is this overexposed?<br/> <br/>Too many people on this site are scoring images based on some quasi-technical checklist, rather than viewing it for what it is: Art.<br/> <br/>This is a gorgeous image with beautiful emotion and technique.<br/> <br/>Oh, and the exposure is fine.</td>', 'Originally posted by jhess77: Strong eyes, a bit over exposed  How is this overexposed? Too many people on this site are scoring images based on some quasi-technical checklist, rather than viewing it for what it is: Art. This is a gorgeous image with beautiful emotion and technique. Oh, and the exposure is fine.', '2008-02-14 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4488102, 642653, 35161, '<td valign="top">Look who''s here... ;)</td>', 'Look who''s here... ;)', '2008-02-15 04:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4488390, 643058, 83080, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t move in closer as suggested below.  The triangles created with her face, ears, and background would have been ruined and that''s part of what makes this such a captivating picture to me.  It always amazes me that some people can score pictures like this below 5.  I wonder if they are just confused and don''t understand that 1 is bad and 10 is good.  :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for a great shot people like me can learn from.</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t move in closer as suggested below.  The triangles created with her face, ears, and background would have been ruined and that''s part of what makes this such a captivating picture to me.  It always amazes me that some people can score pictures like this below 5.  I wonder if they are just confused and don''t understand that 1 is bad and 10 is good.  :) Thanks for a great shot people like me can learn from.', '2008-02-15 08:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4488399, 640299, 83773, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2008-02-15 08:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
