(4497884, 641357, 88656, '<td valign="top">I really like how you captured a feeling in his eyes. I also really like how his hands are by his mouth too! Imo it is a great picture!</td>', 'I really like how you captured a feeling in his eyes. I also really like how his hands are by his mouth too! Imo it is a great picture!', '2008-02-19 13:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
