(4503241, 642041, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eye, and you did a great job of capturing it. It looks like gold filigree. I noticed that the voters in general don''t seem to like reptilian and amphibian eyes very much. I think they are amazing.</td>', 'Beautiful eye, and you did a great job of capturing it. It looks like gold filigree. I noticed that the voters in general don''t seem to like reptilian and amphibian eyes very much. I think they are amazing.', '2008-02-21 01:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4503734, 642866, 86799, '<td valign="top">Dude - this is really interesting.  For a first try I think it''s great.  Yes, the overall focus could be better...but the idea and the flavor is excellent.  Maybe try again.  Could be very good.</td>', 'Dude - this is really interesting.  For a first try I think it''s great.  Yes, the overall focus could be better...but the idea and the flavor is excellent.  Maybe try again.  Could be very good.', '2008-02-21 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4505581, 642550, 53814, '<td valign="top">A wonderful, creative photo and great example of out-of-the-box thinking. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'A wonderful, creative photo and great example of out-of-the-box thinking. Keep up the good work!', '2008-02-21 20:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
