(4546005, 642371, 45475, '<td valign="top">Focus is a big issue with eye shots. Unless blur is absolutely intentional (and that intention is understood by the viewer), out of focus eyes will never work. In future, try stepping back just a little. Could be that you were too close for your camera to focus accurately.</td>', 'Focus is a big issue with eye shots. Unless blur is absolutely intentional (and that intention is understood by the viewer), out of focus eyes will never work. In future, try stepping back just a little. Could be that you were too close for your camera to focus accurately.', '2008-03-07 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4546091, 642504, 45475, '<td valign="top">Too close of a crop. I can see horrible yellow digital noise all the way through this. And it''s not even in focus.</td>', 'Too close of a crop. I can see horrible yellow digital noise all the way through this. And it''s not even in focus.', '2008-03-07 15:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
