(4555671, 641408, 90658, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree with your take on this, the bars!  Also, upon looking through them to what is behind...It is all very dark and compressed.  Lighting, aperture and different angle of shot would take care of that.  Nice job.</td>', 'I would have to agree with your take on this, the bars!  Also, upon looking through them to what is behind...It is all very dark and compressed.  Lighting, aperture and different angle of shot would take care of that.  Nice job.', '2008-03-11 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
