(4566048, 642652, 77196, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. My wife had a good comment. The eyes were supposed to be the focus, but in this shot, the eyes point you away from them - they "give up" the focus rather than grabbing it. <br/> <br/>Welcome to dpchallenge. There is lots of opportunity to learn here. Your shots so far show great creativity, and as you hone your technique, your scores will go up. (I''m still waiting for that to happen...but it will, I know it will... ;-p)</td>', 'I gave this a 5. My wife had a good comment. The eyes were supposed to be the focus, but in this shot, the eyes point you away from them - they "give up" the focus rather than grabbing it.  Welcome to dpchallenge. There is lots of opportunity to learn here. Your shots so far show great creativity, and as you hone your technique, your scores will go up. (I''m still waiting for that to happen...but it will, I know it will... ;-p)', '2008-03-15 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
