(4714196, 641661, 48228, '<td valign="top">This images just <b>POPS</b> right off the page.....<br/> <br/>I like the detail of the iris and lashes..... Extreme macro here, and done really well. <br/> <br/>My only comment to say that this deserved a a higher score, and I feel it would have done so, if the little distraction, with the soft DPF at the bottom of the lashes wasn''t there. <br/> <br/>I love the the color and detail of the iris, and don''t mind the reflection, but don''t like the tiny white blowout on the top left of th iris. These are only very minor details, that if there weren''t there, this would have been a top image, and would have scored much higher, and may have even ribboned.....<br/> <br/>I am very impressed with this image, and you should be very pleased with it as well.</td>', 'This images just POPS right off the page..... I like the detail of the iris and lashes..... Extreme macro here, and done really well.  My only comment to say that this deserved a a higher score, and I feel it would have done so, if the little distraction, with the soft DPF at the bottom of the lashes wasn''t there.  I love the the color and detail of the iris, and don''t mind the reflection, but don''t like the tiny white blowout on the top left of th iris. These are only very minor details, that if there weren''t there, this would have been a top image, and would have scored much higher, and may have even ribboned..... I am very impressed with this image, and you should be very pleased with it as well.', '2008-05-21 05:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
